  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We have yet to determine if Morp's beliefs are accurate and these monsters are made by Mr. Cane, though I wouldn't put it past him.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_048.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I had the vision. He had the capital. And a ruthless streak I did not expect. He's tried multiple times to steal from the Pink Lake.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_049.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And he is foolish enough to unleash monsters on his own resort by mistake. In either event, the answers likely do lie in the Pipeline.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_050.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So the lagoons were Dream Water after all. That madman actually did it. He drilled under the Great Barrier.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_051.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I told you Cane's tried to steal from the Pink Lake, but it's worse than that. I helped him. That was my Walkabout lesson: bring the Dreaming to all.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_052.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That's the appeal of Wallaru. Its only appeal, some say. But the Drovers rebuffed us, so we... adapted.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_053.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-BILLA-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We couldn't bring the real Dreaming to all, so brought the idea of it. We dyed regular water and called it Dreaming.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-BILLA_054.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1608167,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
